# Build context of docker/*.Dockerfile and apps/agent/Dockerfile (repository root). The images
# only COPY package manifests, packages/, apps/, install.sh, deploy/ and docker/; everything
# else is kept out of the context (smaller upload, fewer cache invalidations).
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.git
.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
docs
# Test suites build with their own context (test/e2e, test/e2e/runner) or none at all.
test
**/.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
